  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sesame Producers&apos; Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to increased sales by constructing a storage unit; facilitate transport by acquiring a truck for transport; increase their working capital and establish a revolving fund; and improve quality of products by conducting training in post-harvest techniques.</narrative>
  </description>
